<title>ITALY: Italy's Gewiss buys two German firms.</title>
<headline>Italy's Gewiss buys two German firms.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gewiss, a producer of Italian electrical equipment, said in a statement it had acquired two German companies, Nowa-Plast Gmbh and Multi-Duct KG, in an investment worth around 42 million marks.</p>
<p>Gewiss said in a statement that the companies, with a total turnover of some 35 million marks, had been bought from the Nolten family. The Italian company said it would finance the acquisition mainly through bank debt.</p>
<p>(( -- Milan newsroom +392-66102321 ))</p>
